      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. i think i might have had a tiny bit of peanut in my protein bar or something cuz my skin feels kinda itchy and weird right now. it's not a big deal, just a little annoying. i have a heavy leg day scheduled in like 20 mins and i really don't want to skip it. is it cool if i take my extra strength pre-workout (the one with the high caffeine/stim content) to just power through the session? i just wanna get my lift in.",
