      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i feel fine besides the itch. i dont think it's an actual allergy, just a minor reaction. the pre-workout usually helps me focus and get my heart rate up anyway. plus, i already took like two benadryl so i should be good to go, right? i dont want to waste a huge dose of caffeine because i'm nervous about a tiny bit of itching. can i just take the full scoop? it'll help me stay focused so i dont notice the itch as much.",
